WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.630
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:04.230
ARTHUR BROOKS: One of the things that
people will learn from this course

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.500
is a very simple principle
that one of the guest speakers,

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.360
one of our guests in
this course, teaches us,

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.080
which is that happiness is love.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.379
And what that means is that most of the
big sources of happiness in our life

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:18.400
that we get, they come
from our relationships,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.790
our healthy relationships with
other people, with our family,

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.827
with our friends.

00:00:22.827 --> 00:00:24.660
And that's critically
important because that

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.910
means if we want to put the ideas
in this course into practice

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.993
we have to do it in
conjunction with other people.

00:00:28.993 --> 00:00:30.750
We can't wall ourselves off.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.800
[MUSIC PLAYING]

